@page "/"

<div class="container">
    <h1>Generating fantasy maps</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
        An interactive tutorial based on Martin O'Leary's terrain generation algorithm,
        the engine behind <a href="https://twitter.com/unchartedatlas">@@unchartedatlas</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
        This application is a fully interactive recreation of the fantasy map generator described
        in the original <a href="https://github.com/mewo2/terrain">mewo2/terrain</a> project.
        Each section below lets you explore a different stage of the algorithm, from random point
        generation through to a complete labelled map.
    </p>

    <Section1RandomPoints />
    <Section2VoronoiMesh />
    <Section3Heightmap />
    <Section4Erosion />
    <Section5Features />
    <Section6Cities />
    <Section7Territories />
    <Section8FullMap />
</div>
